  "label": "Environmental Destruction as Metaphor for National Destruction",
  "description": "The image of spraying crops with a hazmat suit is used metaphorically to represent the destruction of a nation. This requires understanding that environmental or agricultural harm can be symbolically linked to national or cultural destruction, a common trope in political and social commentary.",
